    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>ALTERATION UNLIVING VAMPIRE</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 10</p>\n<p>At the brink of destruction your body can dissolve into grave-mist and flee the killing blow.</p>\n<p>Once per day, when you would be reduced to 0 HP, you may immediately become gaseous as if affected by Gaseous Form. This effect occurs before you resolve dying or destruction. You must still obey Sunlight Weakness while gaseous.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: once a day, when a blow would take you to 0 HP, you are asked whether to escape — yes leaves you at 1 HP under Gaseous Form's own effects (10 minutes). Sunlight Weakness still applies.</p>",
